# label: alg:ch07-cfg
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch07.tex:100
# caption: Leader-based construction of the control-flow graph.

REQUIRE flat instruction list C with labels, branches, and jumps
ENSURE block list with Pred and Succ sets for every block
FUNCTION BuildCFG(C)
  mark the first instruction and every labeled instruction as a leader
  mark every instruction after a terminator, including a return, as a leader
  cut the list into blocks starting at each leader
  link each block to its successors from its terminator or fall-through
  invert the successor links to obtain all predecessor sets
END FUNCTION

